---
// Site header, copied verbatim from the live built page (index.html, 2026-10-05).
// `anchorPrefix` is "" on the homepage and "/" on other pages, so the in-page
// anchors keep working from /certifications.
interface Props { anchorPrefix?: string; }
const { anchorPrefix = "" } = Astro.props;
---
<header class="site-header"><a class="home-link" href={anchorPrefix + "#overview"} aria-label="Samgar Nurlan, overview"><svg viewBox="0 0 34 34" width="34" height="34" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 23V10l11 13V10M17 10h11v13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="6" cy="10" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="28" cy="23" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><span>Samgar Nurlan</span></a><nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#experience-healthcare"}>Experience</a><a href={anchorPrefix + "#project-formulation"}>Projects</a><a href="/certifications">Certifications</a><a href={anchorPrefix + "#contact"}>Contact</a></nav><div class="brain-map" data-brain-map><button id="brain-map-toggle" class="brain-map-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="brain-map-panel" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" height="21" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 5 3 10l2 8 7 3 7-4 2-7-6-7-8 2Z M7 5l5 7m-9-2 9 2m-7 6 7-6m0 9v-9m7 5-7-5m9-2-9 2m3-9-3 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><span>Explore the brain</span></button><nav id="brain-map-panel" class="brain-map-panel" aria-labelledby="brain-map-heading" hidden><div class="brain-map-header"><div><h2 id="brain-map-heading">Explore the brain</h2><p>Choose a region. Follow a connection.</p></div><button class="brain-map-close" type="button" aria-label="Close brain map"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="brain-map-layout"><div class="brain-map-atlas"><img class="brain-map-image" src="/images/brain-hero.webp" alt="" width="1600" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><svg class="brain-map-connections" viewBox="0 0 800 700" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="brain-map-network" d="M200 301Q210 167 344 161T544 238Q597 327 528 406T248 462Q142 398 200 301M200 301Q357 233 544 238M344 161Q426 307 528 406M200 301Q367 390 528 406M344 161Q292 318 248 462"></path><path class="brain-map-route" data-map-route d=""></path></svg><ol class="brain-map-regions"><li style="--map-x:25%;--map-y:43%"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#experience-healthcare"} class="brain-map-region" data-map-id="experience-healthcare" data-map-region="0" data-map-x="200" data-map-y="301" data-map-title="The J Healthcare Initiative" data-map-summary="Built a centralized data-management prototype for a nonprofit’s funding, program, and operational information, as part of a six-person development team." data-map-kind="Experience" aria-describedby="map-description-0"><svg class="brain-map-node" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle class="brain-map-node-core" cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><path class="brain-map-node-check" d="m7.5 12 3 3 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="brain-map-region-copy"><span class="brain-map-region-name">Healthcare</span><span class="brain-map-region-state" data-map-state>Experience</span></span></a><span class="visually-hidden" id="map-description-0">Built a centralized data-management prototype for a nonprofit’s funding, program, and operational information, as part of a six-person development team.</span></li><li style="--map-x:68%;--map-y:34%"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#experience-robotics"} class="brain-map-region" data-map-id="experience-robotics" data-map-region="1" data-map-x="544" data-map-y="238" data-map-title="UWaterloo Robotics Team" data-map-summary="Making robot teleoperation more usable, from the keys an operator presses to the velocity commands a robot receives." data-map-kind="Experience" aria-describedby="map-description-1"><svg class="brain-map-node" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle class="brain-map-node-core" cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><path class="brain-map-node-check" d="m7.5 12 3 3 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="brain-map-region-copy"><span class="brain-map-region-name">Robotics</span><span class="brain-map-region-state" data-map-state>Experience</span></span></a><span class="visually-hidden" id="map-description-1">Making robot teleoperation more usable, from the keys an operator presses to the velocity commands a robot receives.</span></li><li style="--map-x:43%;--map-y:23%"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#experience-teaching"} class="brain-map-region" data-map-id="experience-teaching" data-map-region="2" data-map-x="344" data-map-y="161" data-map-title="ACM @ CCNY" data-map-summary="Helping students turn curiosity into practical programming skills." data-map-kind="Experience" aria-describedby="map-description-2"><svg class="brain-map-node" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle class="brain-map-node-core" cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><path class="brain-map-node-check" d="m7.5 12 3 3 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="brain-map-region-copy"><span class="brain-map-region-name">Teaching</span><span class="brain-map-region-state" data-map-state>Experience</span></span></a><span class="visually-hidden" id="map-description-2">Helping students turn curiosity into practical programming skills.</span></li><li style="--map-x:66%;--map-y:58%"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#project-formulation"} class="brain-map-region" data-map-id="project-formulation" data-map-region="3" data-map-x="528" data-map-y="406" data-map-title="Form-ulation" data-map-summary="A computer vision system that turns webcam movement into real-time feedback on bicep curl form." data-map-kind="Project" aria-describedby="map-description-3"><svg class="brain-map-node" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle class="brain-map-node-core" cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><path class="brain-map-node-check" d="m7.5 12 3 3 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="brain-map-region-copy"><span class="brain-map-region-name">Form-ulation</span><span class="brain-map-region-state" data-map-state>Project</span></span></a><span class="visually-hidden" id="map-description-3">A computer vision system that turns webcam movement into real-time feedback on bicep curl form.</span></li><li style="--map-x:31%;--map-y:66%"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#project-payguard"} class="brain-map-region" data-map-id="project-payguard" data-map-region="4" data-map-x="248" data-map-y="462" data-map-title="PayGuard" data-map-summary="A platform that flags potentially suspicious invoices and transactions for review before payment." data-map-kind="Project" aria-describedby="map-description-4"><svg class="brain-map-node" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle><circle class="brain-map-node-core" cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><path class="brain-map-node-check" d="m7.5 12 3 3 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="brain-map-region-copy"><span class="brain-map-region-name">PayGuard</span><span class="brain-map-region-state" data-map-state>Project</span></span></a><span class="visually-hidden" id="map-description-4">A platform that flags potentially suspicious invoices and transactions for review before payment.</span></li></ol></div><div class="brain-map-detail" aria-hidden="true"><h3 data-map-detail-title>Find your way through the work.</h3><p class="brain-map-detail-kind" data-map-detail-kind>Experience &amp; projects</p><p class="brain-map-detail-summary" data-map-detail-summary>Hover or focus a region to see what’s inside. Select it to visit that chapter.</p><div class="brain-map-journey"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 16" width="48" height="16" fill="none"><path d="M3 12Q19-5 43 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></path><circle cx="3" cy="12" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="43" cy="8" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><span>Your route takes shape as you explore.</span></div></div></div><div class="brain-map-footer"><p class="brain-map-progress" data-map-progress>0 of 5 regions visited</p><div class="brain-map-other-links"><a href={anchorPrefix + "#overview"} data-map-id="overview">Overview<span class="visually-hidden" data-map-state></span></a><a href={anchorPrefix + "#skills"} data-map-id="skills">Skills &amp; education<span class="visually-hidden" data-map-state></span></a><a href={anchorPrefix + "#contact"} data-map-id="contact">Contact<span class="visually-hidden" data-map-state></span></a><a href="/certifications" data-map-id="certifications">Certifications<span class="visually-hidden" data-map-state></span></a></div></div></nav></div><button id="view-toggle" class="view-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" width="18" height="18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="13" height="11" rx="2" stroke="currentColor"></rect><path d="M6.5 4v10" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Simple view</span></button></header>
